# An immortal's own settings: wiznet's options, and prefix. In the temple (3001): Seraph (56) and Decimus (10).
# With wiznet on and logins chosen, Seraph sees Knocker log in. A prefix goes in front of every line typed (alias.c's
# substitute_alias); setting or changing one says so (stock said nothing, #97), and its messages end in "\n\r" (stock: "\r\n").
@connect ser
Seraph
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as ser
wiznet
wiznet
wiznet on
wiznet off
wiznet on
wiznet status
wiznet show
wiznet nothing
wiznet secure
wiznet logins
wiznet status
@connect knock
Knocker
psswrd
@return
@return
@as ser
wiznet logins
wiznet status
prefix
prefi
